          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g7AVL",
              "name": "e",
              "fill": "#241F1A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "③ 根因与规则",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cWKbh",
              "name": "f",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "根因：body 是有界高度的列 flex 容器（height:100%），#app-settings 与 .sgroup 都是 flex item，默认 flex-shrink:1 —— 内容高过视口时它们先被压扁、再滚动，顺序反了。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vDU0w",
              "name": "g",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "规则（在已签稿上加一条）：文字和控件都不出卡片 —— 已签稿只钉了左右两轴；本稿补上下两轴。卡片不得被压到内容以下。禁止用 overflow:hidden 掩盖。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "TfDRo",
          "name": "④ 判据",
          "width": 360,
          "fill": "#FFFDF9",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#E4D9C8",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
