          "name": "② 根因",
          "width": 380,
          "fill": "#FFFDF9",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#E4D9C8",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OXVCl",
              "name": "c",
              "fill": "#241F1A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "② 根因",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g7zeXo",
              "name": "d",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "<ol class=\"steps\"> 全仓库没有任何 CSS 规则，于是走浏览器的默认列表标记。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "K7iC7m",
              "name": "e",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "标记不是元素：它由排版引擎画在内容盒之外。现有探针是「逐元素比左右边」，从结构上就看不见它 —— 这就是它一直没红的原因。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BmzGr",
              "name": "f",
              "fill": "#B3261E",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "所以这条不能靠「再调一次间距」修：只要还依赖默认标记，编号就可能落在卡片外。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
