              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "① 「译成」改的是**方向**，不改识别：对方说什么语言仍然靠 LID 判（判错仍然可能）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xQJQ0",
              "name": "代价·2",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "② 译文语言与「对方语言」是两件事：译成 = 你读得懂的；对方语言 = 他说的那门，用来决定你自己的话译成什么。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zrh09",
              "name": "代价·3",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "③ 默认值只在**没设过**时生效（系统语言）；设过一次就存下来，之后不再跟着系统变 —— 与既有「译成」同一套回落规则。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DmOvV",
              "name": "代价·4",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "④ 设置页那一项（只管文档/系统/快速翻译）不动；听译这一处是它自己的键，两处不能互相改。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
