        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "DsrGM",
          "name": "⑤ 按住说的行与自动行一致，且不需要「换到另一门」",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 18,
          "stroke": "#E6E1D6",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O4Gee",
              "name": "规则",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "按住说的行与自动识别的行用同一套行渲染（原文 / 译文 / 朗读 / 给对方看 / 星标都在）。唯一不同：它的语言是人指定的。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wACvr",
              "name": "所以",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "按住说出的行不显示那个互换按钮、也不接受换语言 —— 语言是刚按下去那个人指定的，猜都不用猜。自动识别的行仍然有（那里才是按语言猜的）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
