              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "样式门禁：按钮条只用调色板里真实存在的变量（--sage-light 或 --card-bg 加 --border）；两半等宽、高至少 56pt（稿里 60pt）、圆角、实心底；按下与锁定用 --accent-deep 加白字；禁用 45% 透明加原因句。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "f4NV6g",
              "name": "要点 1",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "CSS 变量门禁：CSS 里 var(--x) 引用的每个变量都必须在调色板或 token 文件里定义过 —— 这次「纯文字」事故的直接对策。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "b7J2Si",
              "name": "要点 2",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "P 组可视断言：两半底色不透明、圆角大于 0、高度至少 56px、两半宽度差小于 2px。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
