              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "位置：按钮条固定贴底（iPhone 在安全区之上、Mac 贴窗口底），控制区整体上移；不再依赖 720px 以上的网格。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
